433	# GitHub Projects MCP Server
434	
435	[![smithery badge](https://smithery.ai/badge/mcp-github-projects)](https://smithery.ai/server/taylor-lindores-reeves/mcp-github-projects)
436	
437	An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that enables AI agents to create and manage Agile Sprint-based projects using GitHub Projects.
438	
439	<a href="https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/86aw338aa5">
440	  <img width="380" height="200" src="https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/86aw338aa5/badge" alt="GitHub Projects Server MCP server" />
441	</a>
442	
443	## Features
444	
445	- **GitHub Projects v2 API**: Full support for GitHub's GraphQL Projects v2 API
446	- **GitHub Issues**: Create, read, and update GitHub issues
447	- **GitHub Repositories**: Fetch repository details
448	- **Type Safety**: Built with TypeScript for maximum type safety
449	
450	## Project Structure
451	
452	This MCP server is built with a layered architecture that separates concerns and promotes maintainability. The codebase provides typed access to GitHub's GraphQL API with comprehensive error handling and security features.
453	
454	### Directory Overview
455	
456	```
457	├── src/                       # Source code directory
458	│   ├── index.ts               # MCP server entry point & tool registration
459	│   ├── operations/            # Business logic layer

