# GitHub Repository: ShunsukeHayashi/rpgmaker-mz-mcp

## Repository Overview

| Detail | Information |
|---|---|
| **Owner** | ShunsukeHayashi |
| **Repository** | rpgmaker-mz-mcp |
| **Description** | RPG Maker MZ MCP |
| **Stars** | 28 |
| **Forks** | 1 |
| **License** | MIT |
| **Last Updated** | March 5, 2025 |
| **Languages** | TypeScript, JavaScript, CSS |
| **Topics** | `#mcp` `#rpgmaker` |
| **URL** | [github.com/ShunsukeHayashi/rpgmaker-mz-mcp](https://github.com/ShunsukeHayashi/rpgmaker-mz-mcp) |

## Description

This repository is an **MCP (Model Context Protocol) Server** for **RPG Maker MZ**. It enables communication between RPG Maker MZ and external AI/model services through the MCP protocol.

## Key Information

- **Purpose**: Provides an interface between RPG Maker MZ and Model Context Protocol, allowing AI/LLM integration with the game engine
- **Primary Language**: TypeScript
- **License**: MIT (open source)
- **Community Interest**: 28 stars, 1 fork

## What is MCP?

MCP (Model Context Protocol) is an open protocol that standardizes how applications provide context to LLMs (Large Language Models). This server acts as a bridge, allowing RPG Maker MZ to connect with AI services for enhanced game development workflows.

